        "checkedAt": "2026-11-19T19:00:38.812Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Starting from a text prompt, a reference image, or both, developers can experiment with generating continuous 720p worlds at 24fps with synchronized native audio — from ambient soundscapes and sound effects to character dialogue.",
